OL,3,GNEWSABiogas plant scheme on former
OL,4,Amushroom farm refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a biogas plant at a
OL,7,Fformer mushroom farm on the edge of
OL,8,FMarket Harborough have been rejected by
OL,9,Fcouncillors.
OL,11,FGreat Bowden Green Energy Ltd wanted to
OL,12,Fbuild the anaerobic digestion facility
OL,13,Fat Marigold Farm, off Welham Way in
OL,14,FGreat Bowden, which would process
OL,15,Fchicken manure, maize and straw to
OL,16,Fcreate renewable low-carbon gas to feed
OL,17,Fback into the grid.
OL,19,FHowever, members of Leicestershire
OL,20,FCounty Council's development control
OL,21,Fboard voted to refuse planning
OL,22,Fpermission for the project on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
