OL,3,GNEWSABiogas plant scheme on former
OL,4,Amushroom farm refused
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey said they were worried the
OL,7,Findustrial development would cause harm
OL,8,Fto the rural area, potential odour, and
OL,9,Fabout the impact of lorries travelling
OL,10,Fto and from the site.
